NAME
    sysinfo - print host hardware and EmuSen process resource telemetry

SYNOPSIS
    sysinfo [--json]

DESCRIPTION
    Prints a one-shot telemetry snapshot of the host machine and the running
    EmuSen process. Host metrics include CPU model, core/thread topology,
    per-core and aggregate frequencies (cpufreq), total and iowait CPU
    utilization, memory and swap usage, DRM GPU utilization/VRAM/GTT and
    temperature (with N/A where sysfs lacks an attribute), and deduplicated
    filesystem mount usage.

    Process metrics include CPU utilization as both percentage of total host
    capacity and percentage of a single logical core (flagging single-core
    bottlenecks), per-thread group totals (core, audio, render, ui, jobs,
    other), RSS/PSS/Private RAM from smaps_rollup, DRM fdinfo GPU engine
    utilization and VRAM/GTT allocations, and cached Galaxia writable vs.
    read-only game library directory sizes.

OPTIONS
    --json
        Emit the structured telemetry snapshot as compact JSON.

EXAMPLES
    sysinfo
    sysinfo --json

EXIT STATUS
    0   Telemetry snapshot printed.
    1   Unknown option or serialization error.

SEE ALSO
    coretop(1), summary(1)
